{"about_the_game":"My Friend Pedro is a violent ballet about friendship, imagination, and one man\u2019s struggle to obliterate anyone in his path at the behest of a sentient banana. The strategic use of split aiming, slow motion, and the ol\u2019 stylish window breach create one sensational action sequence after another in an explosive battle through the violent underworld.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557340/extras/MFP_Steam_Gif_2.jpg?t=1738277402\" /><br><strong><br>Full Throttle Gun Ballet:</strong> Unleash a torrent of destruction with an incredible level of control over both your weapons and your body. Twist and turn through the air while aiming both hands at priority threats or line up a perfect ricochet to drop an unsuspecting gangster from behind. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557340/extras/MFP_Steam_Pedro_peek_4.jpg?t=1738277402\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557340/extras/bottom_banana.jpg?t=1738277402\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Because video games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557340/0ba7ada6e12ec5c6eb31fb3ba403e16b29d440e9.jpg"},{"name":"Make an entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557340/6dbb59b2146422db877937d5f8e7ba75a1dc9887.jpg"},{"name":"Three birds, one explosion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557340/d9e943e5b927f3036b62532b99e80b97211fcf8d.jpg"},{"name":"Mumbo Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557340/6329941c92d6ed3be5f4bc4ae23cfddecc8e8626.jpg"},{"name":"Comb-o-ver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557340/57de9d8165b701aca07483852b1cdb978f57d363.jpg"},{"name":"Ah, Combon now!","path":"